# Output contract: Review iteration

## Required stdout signals (exactly one)

- `<promise>REVIEW_PASS</promise>` — verify green, no blockers in review-notes.
- `<promise>NEEDS_FIX</promise>` — blockers listed; next iteration is implement/fix.

## Review notes format (`loop/review-notes.md`)

```md
## Review — iteration {{N}}

### Blockers
- [ ] ...

### Nits
- ...
```

## Forbidden

- `REVIEW_PASS` when verify failed
- Blockers without file/spec reference
